{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/QLTV2Gif.gif?t=1743055407\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the fog-drenched ruins of <strong><i>West Hollow</i></strong>, a crumbling town where shadows stretch too long and silence hides danger. Search for a lost love amid haunted streets, abandoned diners, and forsaken schools, piecing together a truth buried in the mist. Armed with little more than a flashlight, explore a world of eerie echoes and unseen threats\u2014every corner holds a whisper, every step a risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/extras/Vid2Gif.gif?t=1743055407\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the mystery of a quiet little town turned nightmare in this atmospheric blend of exploration and survival, where  answers might come at a cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich, detailed environment that rewards players who explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For fans of <i>Firewatch\u00a0</i>and <i>What Remains of Edith Finch</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611030?t=1743055407","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611030?t=1743055407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/ad4d91f7e4f6fa46bfb3266024f54b59ac3bde83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743055407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611030/ad4d91f7e4f6fa46bfb3266024f54b59ac3bde83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743055407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"des